Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:43:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ...Bounded+forEach Property.Inout.swift => Property.Borrow.swift} | 0
 ...er.Slab+forEach Property.Inout.swift => Property.Borrow.swift} | 0
 ....Slab.Small where S is ~Copyable, S.Element is Copyable.swift} | 0
 3 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Buffer Slab Bounded Primitive/{Buffer.Slab.Bounded+forEach Property.Inout.swift => Property.Borrow.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Buffer Slab Primitive/{Buffer.Slab+forEach Property.Inout.swift => Property.Borrow.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Buffer Slab Small Primitive/{Buffer.Slab.Small Copyable.swift => Buffer.Slab.Small where S is ~Copyable, S.Element is Copyable.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Buffer Slab Bounded Primitive/Buffer.Slab.Bounded+forEach Property.Inout.swift b/Sources/Buffer Slab Bounded Primitive/Property.Borrow.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Buffer Slab Bounded Primitive/Buffer.Slab.Bounded+forEach Property.Inout.swift
rename to Sources/Buffer Slab Bounded Primitive/Property.Borrow.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Buffer Slab Primitive/Buffer.Slab+forEach Property.Inout.swift b/Sources/Buffer Slab Primitive/Property.Borrow.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Buffer Slab Primitive/Buffer.Slab+forEach Property.Inout.swift
rename to Sources/Buffer Slab Primitive/Property.Borrow.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Buffer Slab Small Primitive/Buffer.Slab.Small Copyable.swift b/Sources/Buffer Slab Small Primitive/Buffer.Slab.Small where S is ~Copyable, S.Element is Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Buffer Slab Small Primitive/Buffer.Slab.Small Copyable.swift
rename to Sources/Buffer Slab Small Primitive/Buffer.Slab.Small where S is ~Copyable, S.Element is Copyable.swift
